{"id":"resp_52fdbaa51a96dc7ad02205035735f063","object":"response","created_at":1794484775,"completed_at":1794484788,"status":"completed","error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"output":[{"id":"fs_3d4a967aa787a3640184af6fd88a3da4","type":"file_search_call","status":"completed","queries":["MoE expert capacity offloaded SSD DRAM CPU memory insufficient"],"results":[{"file_id":"file_0304203713e29c167fae9bf9b09bda06","filename":"SSD_OFFLOAD_CONTRACT.md","score":1,"attributes":{},"text":"# Thor统一内存下的SSD offload合同\n\n2026-10-21按用户明确要求建立。本文约束当前与后续MoE expert offload\n的设计、文档和验收；历史报告保留原始事实，不作为与本文冲突的执行计划。\n\n## 唯一容量后备是SSD\n\n本项目的MoE专家**只向SSD做容量卸载**。Thor的CPU和集成GPU共用\n物理DRAM；host、device、managed allocation都来自该内存。把专家从\ndevice allocation移到CPU内存，仍然是RAM驻留，不构成容量卸载。\n这是[CUDA 13.3 Tegra内存说明](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/archive/13.3.0/cuda-for-tegra-appnote/index.html#memory-management)\n与本项目目标共同确定的边界。\n\n“与直接载入内存没有区别”在这里指**没有移出物理RAM**；不代表不同\n分配方式的访问、缓存、拷贝、同步或性能完全相同。统一物理内存也不\n自动消除现有H2D/D2H或重复副本。\n\n专家权重保存在只读SSD checkpoint，需要时读入有界工作集供GPU计算。\n当前实现不把GPU驱逐解释为写回SSD：原始权重已在SSD，设备槽可直接\n丢弃或放入既有有界DRAM镜像。修改原模型目录不属于任何优化出口。\n\n## 允许的中转与禁止的容量表述\n\n| 对象或说法 | 当前含义与约束 |\n|---|---|\n| SSD offload | SSD承担不常驻DRAM的专家容量；驻留工作集、缓存与中转受总RAM目标约束 |\n| device专家槽位 | GPU计算使用的DRAM工作集；减少槽位本身不证明整机RAM下降 |\n| pinned staging / host L2 / mirror | DRAM中的中转或缓存；必须计入容量，不能称为另一个offload层 |\n"}]},{"id":"msg_d9e181e8bbda6bbfe813f41ed7a505ba","type":"message","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"According to the project, MoE expert capacity may only be offloaded to SSD [file:file_0304203713e29c167fae9bf9b09bda06]. Moving experts to CPU memory is insufficient because the CPU and integrated GPU share the same physical DRAM, meaning such a move keeps the data resident in RAM rather than achieving true capacity offload [file:file_0304203713e29c167fae9bf9b09bda06].","annotations":[{"type":"file_citation","file_id":"file_0304203713e29c167fae9bf9b09bda06","filename":"SSD_OFFLOAD_CONTRACT.md","index":119},{"type":"file_citation","file_id":"file_0304203713e29c167fae9bf9b09bda06","filename":"SSD_OFFLOAD_CONTRACT.md","index":370}]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":1399,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":171,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0},"total_tokens":1570},"model":"qwen3.8-flash-next","instructions":"Use file_search with exactly one query. Answer from the actual returned source in at most two sentences. Copy its exact citation_marker into your answer. Do not invent file IDs.","metadata":{},"temperature":0,"top_p":1,"parallel_tool_calls":false,"tools":[{"type":"file_search","vector_store_ids":["vs_0debf8b5980370c43961f6692188391e"],"max_num_results":1}],"tool_choice":{"type":"file_search"},"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"reasoning":{"effort":"none","context":"all_turns","mode":"standard","summary":null},"store":true,"background":false,"max_output_tokens":256,"max_tool_calls":1,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_options":{"mode":"implicit","ttl":"30m"},"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","service_tier":"default","truncation":"disabled","top_logprobs":0,"access_programs":null}